  "howto": {
    "what": "装上后会把 OpenCode 的 provider 文件复制进仓库、接好导入、安装依赖并重建 agent 镜像；之后被指定为 opencode 的群组就改用 OpenCode 后端跑 agent。",
    "when": "当你要求给某个群组换用 OpenCode 后端时接管,例如执行 `ncl groups config update --provider opencode` 并重启该群组。",
    "say": [
      {
        "text": "帮我装上 OpenCode provider 并重新构建镜像",
        "note": "会复制文件、装依赖、重建 agent 镜像"
      },
      {
        "text": "把这个群组的 provider 切换成 opencode 并重启",
        "note": "写入 container_configs 并重启群组"
      }
    ],
    "source": "llm",
    "content_hash": "sha256:60706d2b12925e4cb1087650d47707ca1f056b7a3a5ba6d3b6d15a1b12fb23a1",
    "model": "deepseek-v4-flash",
    "generated_at": "2026-09-29T09:31:23.975Z",
    "lint_pass": true,
    "what_en": "Copies the OpenCode provider files into the repo, wires them into the host and container barrels, installs dependencies and rebuilds the agent image. After that, a group whose provider is opencode runs agents through OpenCode.",
    "when_en": "Takes over when you want a group to run on the OpenCode backend instead of the default claude, e.g. `ncl groups config update --provider opencode` then restarting the group.",
    "say_en": [
      {
        "text": "Install the OpenCode provider and rebuild the agent image",
        "note": "Copies files, adds deps, rebuilds image"
      },
      {
        "text": "Switch this group's provider to opencode and restart it",
        "note": "Writes provider into container_configs"
      },
      {
        "text": "Set the OpenCode model to openrouter/anthropic/claude-sonnet-4",
        "note": "Sets OPENCODE_MODEL in .env"
      }
